  "job_B16.10.8_20251003_114351": {
    "chunk_text": "Drihten to \u00f0on swi\u00f0e lufode, \u00fe\u00e6t he And \u00fea\u00f0a he on \u00fe\u00e6re rode for us \u00f0rowode, \u00fea bet\u00e6hte he \u00feam ilcan Iohanne, his dyrlinge, sancta Eac her is of \u00feam heofenlican mete, \u00fee w\u00e6s funden on Iohannes byrgene \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles. Of sanctus Bartholomeus heafde \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles. Of sanctus Iacobes reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles. Of sanctus Stefanes heafde \u00fe\u00e6s forman Cristes martyres & of his halgan blode & of \u00feam stane, \u00f0e he Of sancto Oflamno \u00feam martyre, \u00fee w\u00e6s Petrus m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles. Of sanctus Laurentius reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6\u00f0elan martyres & of \u00feam gl\u00e6don \u00fee he w\u00e6s mid for Cristes Of sancto Uincentio \u00feam dyacone & martyre. Of sanctus Georgies banum \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6ran Cristes cempan & martyres. Of sancte Sebastiane \u00feam martyre manege ban. Of reliquion \u00fe\u00e6ra twegra bro\u00f0ra & martyra Tyburtius & Ualerianes. Of sancto Urbane \u00feam papan & martyre. Of sancto Apollonare \u00feam biscope & martyre. Of sancte Candides banum \u00fe\u00e6s martyres. Of sanctus Mauricies reliquion \u00f0\u00e6s martyres. Of sancto Quintino \u00feam martyre. Of \u00feam martyrum Luciane & Maximiane. Of sancto Quirino martyre. Of sancto Cornelio \u00feam papan & martyre. Of sancto Marcelle. Of sancto Petre \u00feam martyre. Of sancto Iuliane \u00feam martyre. Of reliquion sanctus Cyriaces \u00fe\u00e6s wur\u00f0fullan dyacones & martyres. Of reliquion Crisantes \u00fe\u00e6s martyres & Darian \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6denes. Of sancto Geruasie \u00feam martyre. Of sancto Christofore \u00feam martyre. Of sancte Conones lichaman",
